 score flags elevated compensation governance risk (9/10).","financial_summary":["Airbnb, Inc. is a large-cap consumer cyclical business with a $101.7B market cap on $12.2B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +13% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 1786% against a 12% cost of capital \u2014 a 1774-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 3.7% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and stock-based comp at 13% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome, and within its sector the business captures 2.6\u00d7 its fair share of profits, a structural advantage visible in the numbers."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 200% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":1.9999476216010181},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $46.5M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Consumer Cyclical tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Consumer staples outperforming discretionary, signaling cautious spending","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"High market volatility with VIX at 36, signaling elevated fear","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Widening credit spreads suggest growing stress in corporate debt markets","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Broad market in a downtrend, trading below its 200-day average","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Multiple macro indicators signal economic contraction","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Consumer demand is fundamentally cyclical \u2014 a recession compresses both unit volume and pricing power, and operating leverage cuts both ways.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Operating margins 13% above sector median \u2014 the quantitative trace of pricing power","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Among the least levered in Consumer Cyclical \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Consumer Cyclical sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 5% over 3 months"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Airbnb (ABNB) Is Under Fresh US Scrutiny Over Chinese AI Use","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/consumer-services/nasdaq-abnb/airbnb/news/airbnb-abnb-is-under-fresh-us-scrutiny-over-chinese-ai-use","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795191013.066,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.772,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Airbnb (NASDAQ:ABNB) Stock Price Expected to Rise, Sanford C. Bernstein Analyst Says","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/20/airbnb-nasdaqabnb-stock-price-expected-to-rise-sanford-c-bernstein-analyst-says.html","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795185528.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.7,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Airbnb, Inc. $ABNB Share